pro_course_detail.description:
Beginners and Pre-Intermediate Students

For absolute beginners and pre-intermediate Students I strongly recommend a customized learning program that allows them to become independent users of the target language in real-life contexts.
My lessons generally cover all the foundational skills of language learning: grammar, writing, listening, speaking as well as reading and vocabulary.

As a tutor, I will help you:

•	build confidence and have fun learning a new language;
•	introduce and speak about yourself;
•	focus on basic grammar, vocabulary and pronunciation;
•	understand and slowly master real-life language, through the study of idioms and everyday uses of Italian language;
•	learn the basics of writing.

***
Intermediate and Advanced Students

Students from Intermediate to Advanced levels will have the opportunity to improve their linguistic skills through a highly structured plan of lessons, specifically designed to help them master the target language. This program addresses those students who need to improve their vocabulary and strengthen their prior knowledge. 

We will focus on:

•	reading articles and discussing topics of interest;
•	boosting your confidence in all the linguistic skills: reading, writing, listening and speaking;
•	advanced grammar structures;
•	advanced idioms and writing structures.

I provide my students with plenty of examples, audiovisual resources and exercise to ensure the concepts are clearly understood.

***
Conversation Practice in Italian

This plan is specifically designed for advanced students who intend to master Italian language, learn more about advanced linguistic structures and words, or simply want to have fun speaking with an Italian/Neapolitan native speaker. 
I will help you master idioms and everyday language.

Hope to see you soon - A presto

